hadiths[23]{hadithnumber,text}:
"665","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah farmayega: Aey Adam ke bete! Main ne tum se khana manga lekin tum ne Mujhe khana nahin khilaya. Woh kahega: Aey Rabb! Main Tujhe kaise khana khilata jabke Tu Rabbul Aalameen hai? Woh farmayega: Kya tum nahin jante ke Mere falan bande ne tum se khana manga lekin tum ne use khana nahin khilaya? Kya tum nahin jante ke agar tum use khana khilate to tum use Mere paas pate. Aey Adam ke bete! Main ne tum se pani manga lekin tum ne Mujhe pani nahin pilaya. Woh kahega: Aey Rabb! Main Tujhe kaise pani pilata jabke Tu Rabbul Aalameen hai? Woh farmayega: Kya tum nahin jante ke Mere falan bande ne tum se pani manga, kya tum nahin jante ke agar tum use pani pilate to tum use Mere paas pate? Aey Adam ke bete! Main beemar hua lekin tum ne Meri iyadat nahin ki. Woh kahega: Aey Rabb! Main Teri iyadat kaise karta jabke Tu Rabbul Aalameen hai? Allah Ta'ala farmayega: Kya tum nahin jante ke Mera falan banda beemar tha, agar tum us ki iyadat karte to tum use Mere paas pate.' Ya: 'Tum Mujhe us ke paas pate.'"
"666","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pichli hadees ki manind riwayat hai, aur is tarah bayan kiya: 'Agar tum us ki iyadat karte to tum Mujhe us ke paas pate.'"
"667","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Kalonji mein har beemari ke liye shifa hai siwae saam ke, aur saam maut hai.'"
"668","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Khumbi mann ka bacha hua hissa hai (woh khana jo Bani Israil par utara gaya tha); us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai.'"
"669","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mut'addi beemari, badshuguni, aur Safar ki nahusat mein koi haqeeqat nahin hai.'"
"670","[AI-translation] Abu Hakam Bahili se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya jabke woh pichhne lagwa rahe the. To unhon ne kaha: Aey Abul Hakam! Kya tum ne kabhi pichhne lagwaye hain? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kabhi pichhne nahin lagwaye. To Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen bataya ke Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ne unhen bataya ke un cheezon mein se jin se log ilaj karte hain, pichhne sab se nafa bakhsh hain."
"671","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah Azza wa Jalla bukhar se farmata hai: Tum Meri aag ho; Main tumhen duniya mein apne momin bande par dalta hun taake woh us ke liye jahannam ki aag se hissa ban jae.'"
"672","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo kahin ya najumi ke paas jae aur us ki kahi hui baat ki tasdeeq kare (use sachcha samjhe), to us ne us ka inkar kiya jo Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nazil hua.'"
"673","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham (Rasool ke sahaba) ne is ayat ki samajh mein ikhtilaf kiya: 'Jaise kharab darakht, zameen ki satah se ukhada hua, use qiyam nahin hai.' Ham ne kaha: Ham gumaan karte hain woh khumbi hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tashreef laae aur farmaya: 'Tum kya bahas kar rahe ho?' Ham ne kaha: Us darakht ke bare mein jise Allah ne is ayat mein zikr farmaya. Ham ne kaha: Ham use khumbi murad lete hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Khumbi us «مَن» mein se hai jo Bani Israil par utara gaya tha; us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai, aur ajwah (khajoor) jannat se hai aur woh zahar ka tod hai.'"
"674","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Akzar (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Parinde ko us ke ghonsle (rahne ki jagah) mein rahne do.' (Use shugun lene ke liye na udao.)"
"675","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un saanpon ko qatl karne se mana farmaya jo gharon mein pae jate hain, siwae kate dum wale saanp aur do lakeeron wale ke. Kyunke woh donon andhapan late hain aur auraton ko hamal gira dete hain. To jo in donon ko chhod de (baghair qatl kiye) woh ham mein se nahin hai."
"676","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Upar ke ilaqe (Najd) ki Ajwah khajooren shifa hain, ya woh zahar ka tod hain.'"
"677","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Munzir bint Qais (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere ghar tashreef laae, aur Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) Aap ke sath the. Woh beemari se theek hue the aur is liye kamzor the. Hamare ghar mein adhpaki khajooron ke guchche latke hue the. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) un mein se khane lage. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya: 'Thehro, tum (abhi beemari se theek hue ho aur) kamzor ho.' To Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ruk gae. Unhon (Umm Munzir Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Main ne jau aur chukandar pakaya tha, phir main use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Ali! Is mein se lo (aur khao), kyunke yeh tumhare liye ziyada nafa bakhsh hai.'"
"678","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Qais bint Mihsan (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke woh apne bete ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein lain. Main ne gale ki beemari ke khauf se us ke gale ko apni ungli se dabaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum apne bachchon ke galon ko apni ungli se aise kyun dabati ho? Tumhen is Hindi lakdi (qust) ko istemal karna chahiye.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke bete ko liya, aur us ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par peshab kar diya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pani mangwaya aur us par dala ya chhidka. Rawi ne kaha: To yeh tareeqa muqarrar ho gaya ke agar bachcha khana na khae to us ke peshab par pani chhidka jayega, aur agar woh khana khae to us ka peshab dhoya jayega."
"679","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Hatib se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Meri walida mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lain. Unhon ne shorba banaya tha, aur woh mere jism par gir pada. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kuch farmaya, lekin main nahin janta woh kya tha. Jab Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ka daur aaya to meri walida ne mujhe bataya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh dua padhi thi: 'Aey logon ke Rabb! Beemari door farma. Tu Shafi hai. Shifa ata farma. Tere siwa koi shafi nahin hai.'"
"680","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagwae aur pichhne lagane wale ko us ki ujrat di."
"681","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagwae aur pichhne lagane wale ko us ki ujrat di."
"682","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagwae aur naak mein dawa dali gai."
"683","[AI-translation] Abu Ja'far se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki naak mein tel ki dawa dali gai."
"684","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aey logon! Ilaj karo, kyunke Allah ne koi beemari paida nahin farmai magar Us ne us ki shifa bhi paida farmai hai, siwae «السَّام» ke, aur «السَّام» ka ma'na maut hai.'"
"685","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Shareek (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main hazir tha jab dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sawal kar rahe the: Kya hamare liye aisa aur aisa karne mein koi harj hai? Kya hamare liye aisa aur aisa karne mein koi gunah hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Allah ke bandon! Allah ne tangi door farmai hai, siwae us ke jo apne bhai ki izzat mein se kuch kaate; to yahi shakhs hai jis ne gunah kiya aur halak hua.' Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham ilaj karen? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Ilaj karo, kyunke Allah ne har beemari ke liye shifa utari hai jo Us ne utari hai, siwae maut ke.' Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Bande ko di gai sab se behtareen cheez kya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Husn khulq.'"
"686","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Shuraik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main dehatiyon ke sath hazir tha jab woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sawal kar rahe the. Phir rawi ne wohi (waqiya) zikr kiya, aur is mein unhon ne yeh izafa bayan kiya: Jab woh Aap (Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne khade hue to woh Aap ke mubarak hath ko chumne lage. Rawi ne kaha: Main ne Aap ke mubarak hath ko apne hath se chhua, aur woh mushk se ziyada khushbudar tha."
"687","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar tumhare istemal kiye ilajon mein koi khair hai to woh pichhne lagane wale ke khoon nikalne mein hai.'"
